### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create a transfer transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a deposit transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a withdrawal transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 45.25,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### List all transactions (newest first)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Combined filter (account + type + date range)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31

### Get account balance (multi-currency)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Get account balance filtered by currency
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance?currency=USD

### Validation error example (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "INVALID",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -10.555,
  "currency": "ZZZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Unknown account example (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-99999/balance
